# Personal smoke settings; keep neutral example templates
/SmokeTests/**/*.local.json
/SmokeTests/**/*.local.txt
/SmokeTests/**/*.local.ps1
/SmokeTests/**/*.local.py
/SmokeTests/**/*.local.csv
/SmokeTests/results/
/SmokeTests/artifacts/
/SmokeTests/private/

# Machine-specific captures and generated probe executables belong in /output/.
# Retain neutral harness sources, runners and placeholder templates in SmokeTests.

# Keep dependency sources, SDKs, licenses and intentional bundled runtimes.
# Do not blanket-ignore *.exe, *.dll, *.lib, bin/, Debug/ or Release/.
